{"assets":["/statement-assets/ec0b0b271386a3da4e74664848ecae4449b04575636e78c12f5fd29acb32a420.png"],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"832","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"D. Misha, Grisha and Underground"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"2 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Misha and Grisha are funny boys, so they like to use new underground. The underground has "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" stations connected with "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n - 1"},{"kind":"text","text":" routes so that each route connects two stations, and it is possible to reach every station from any other."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The boys decided to have fun and came up with a plan. Namely, in some day in the morning Misha will ride the underground from station "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"s"},{"kind":"text","text":" to station "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"f"},{"kind":"text","text":" by the shortest path, and will draw with aerosol an ugly text \"Misha was here\" on every station he will pass through (including "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"s"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"f"},{"kind":"text","text":"). After that on the same day at evening Grisha will ride from station "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"t"},{"kind":"text","text":" to station "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"f"},{"kind":"text","text":" by the shortest path and will count stations with Misha's text. After that at night the underground workers will wash the texts out, because the underground should be clean. "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The boys have already chosen three stations "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"a"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"b"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"c"},{"kind":"text","text":" for each of several following days, one of them should be station "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"s"},{"kind":"text","text":" on that day, another should be station "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"f"},{"kind":"text","text":", and the remaining should be station "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"t"},{"kind":"text","text":". They became interested how they should choose these stations "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"s"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"f"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"t"},{"kind":"text","text":" so that the number Grisha will count is as large as possible. They asked you for help."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains two integers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"q"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"2 ≤ n ≤ 105"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ q ≤ 105"},{"kind":"text","text":") — the number of stations and the number of days."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The second line contains "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n - 1"},{"kind":"text","text":" integers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"p2, p3, ..., pn"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ pi ≤ n"},{"kind":"text","text":"). The integer "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"pi"},{"kind":"text","text":" means that there is a route between stations "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"pi"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":". It is guaranteed that it's possible to reach every station from any other."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The next "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"q"},{"kind":"text","text":" lines contains three integers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"a"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"b"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"c"},{"kind":"text","text":" each ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ a, b, c ≤ n"},{"kind":"text","text":") — the ids of stations chosen by boys for some day. Note that some of these ids could be same."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Print "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"q"},{"kind":"text","text":" lines. In the "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th of these lines print the maximum possible number Grisha can get counting when the stations "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"s"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"t"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"f"},{"kind":"text","text":" are chosen optimally from the three stations on the "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th day."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"3 2\n1 1\n1 2 3\n2 3 3\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"2\n3\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"4 1\n1 2 3\n1 2 3\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"2\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the first example on the first day if "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"s"},{"kind":"text","text":" = "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"f"},{"kind":"text","text":" = "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"2"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"t"},{"kind":"text","text":" = "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"3"},{"kind":"text","text":", Misha would go on the route "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1"},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/ec0b0b271386a3da4e74664848ecae4449b04575636e78c12f5fd29acb32a420.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"2"},{"kind":"text","text":", and Grisha would go on the route "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"3"},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/ec0b0b271386a3da4e74664848ecae4449b04575636e78c12f5fd29acb32a420.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1"},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/ec0b0b271386a3da4e74664848ecae4449b04575636e78c12f5fd29acb32a420.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"2"},{"kind":"text","text":". He would see the text at the stations "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"2"},{"kind":"text","text":". On the second day, if "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"s"},{"kind":"text","text":" = "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"3"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"f"},{"kind":"text","text":" = "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"2"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"t"},{"kind":"text","text":" = "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"3"},{"kind":"text","text":", both boys would go on the route "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"3"},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/ec0b0b271386a3da4e74664848ecae4449b04575636e78c12f5fd29acb32a420.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1"},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/ec0b0b271386a3da4e74664848ecae4449b04575636e78c12f5fd29acb32a420.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"2"},{"kind":"text","text":". Grisha would see the text at "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"3"},{"kind":"text","text":" stations."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the second examle if "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"s"},{"kind":"text","text":" = "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"f"},{"kind":"text","text":" = "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"3"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"t"},{"kind":"text","text":" = "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"2"},{"kind":"text","text":", Misha would go on the route "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1"},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/ec0b0b271386a3da4e74664848ecae4449b04575636e78c12f5fd29acb32a420.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"2"},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/ec0b0b271386a3da4e74664848ecae4449b04575636e78c12f5fd29acb32a420.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"3"},{"kind":"text","text":", and Grisha would go on the route "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"2"},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/ec0b0b271386a3da4e74664848ecae4449b04575636e78c12f5fd29acb32a420.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"3"},{"kind":"text","text":" and would see the text at both stations."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"D","problemCode":"832D","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/832/problem/D"}